WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.025
Let’s walk through Record an explicit outcome.

00:00:03.025 --> 00:00:05.688
On this slide, use the review footer to approve

00:00:05.688 --> 00:00:09.800
unchanged output, record an evidence-based override, or send

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.488
incomplete work back.

00:00:11.488 --> 00:00:14.700
In practice, make the outcome explicit and preserve the

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:18.450
rationale another operator needs to audit the decision.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:22.175
Use the highlighted Workflow controls area as your visual reference

00:00:22.175 --> 00:00:23.850
while you complete this check.
